      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chila mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu nkutsambulwa kula kpwa anadamu kuhumikira Mlungu kpwa niaba yao. Naye nkulavya zawadi na sadaka zao za kuausira dambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anaweza kuaonera mbazi ayae asiomanya na anaoangamika kpwa kuhenda makosa, kpwa vira hata ye mwenye ni mnyonje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Alawi 9:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiyo mana ni lazima alavye sadaka kudziusira dambize mwenye, dza viratu alavyavyo sadaka kuusira dambi ayae. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.28.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 28:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona, takuna mutu ambaye anaweza kudzipha cheo cha kukala mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu, ela atsambulwe ni Mlungu dza viratu vyotsambulwa Aruni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5:4",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Aruni",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "kala ni mlavyadzi-sadaka mkpwulu wa kpwandza. (Soma chitabu cha",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.28.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kutsama 28:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
